codex
A more robust proof shape is available because the contract is finite. I’m replacing the difficult symbolic quotient normalization with one deterministic reachability claim that walks every input from `0` through `10000`; for each input it executes the exact translated AST and an independent recursive K oracle, advances only when their `Value`s unify, and reaches `done` only after all 10,001 comparisons succeed.
